  "schema": "stock-monitor-child-env-names-v1",
  "description": "The application environment variables a child process (Health, the Python services, the provider daemons, Rust A/B, the jobs) inherits from its launcher: a closed list, read by service/platform/js/child_env.js. The config/var_layout.json locations pass too, and a secret-looking name never does (a role gets credentials only through its grant). tests/child_env_names_contract.cjs fails when the code names an application variable that is in neither list.",
